Package: llikert
Title: Likert scales and Multiple Choice with Next-Token Probabilities
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Louis Teitelbaum", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "louis@teitelbaum.us")
Description: Reproducibly rate texts on ordinal or categorical scales using
    next-token probabilities from an open-weights language model with llama.cpp. 
    Supports local inference through Python and remote inference through Hugging 
    Face Inference Endpoints.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/rimonim/llikert
BugReports: https://github.com/rimonim/llikert/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cli,
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    openssl,
    pillar,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
